{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0263_1000_p", "source_sha256": "31537d0181cff39517961c41f90df50eeea2ff5962434cf039d770b4ead917f8", "ja": "（『765プロ　クッキング大運動会』が終わった。\nなんだかんだで、楽しいイベントになったな！）", "zh": "（『765职业烹饪大运动会』结束了。不管怎么说，这次活动办得很开心啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0263_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "16818fc386cb0046b105085b465463d4a2cceb28fd387e70b722725fb0364c0e", "ja": "お疲れさま、{$P$}さん！\nコーヒー持ってきたよ！　はい、どうぞ。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生！\n我把咖啡拿来了！来，给你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0263_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4a781b3d7c498d7e4d5d24dfca39264716d784c073f90607f04d9d4640381040", "ja": "あ、ありがとう……。\nどうしてコーヒーなんだ？　育。", "zh": "啊，谢谢……  \n为什么是咖啡？育。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0263_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "89fc1ae19ad2a224b358e3290f6e875b88307774cced34dd69d3e4fd8a7e18f2", "ja": "疲れた時はコーヒーだって、おとうさんが言ってたの。\n{$P$}さん、疲れてるみたいだから。", "zh": "爸爸说过，累的时候就该喝咖啡。\n因为{$P$}先生好像累了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0263_1004_p", "source_sha256": "2cf910db14694954ad52bb92955ab324255ccc4d83c6994f42ab1a65911582cf", "ja": "そうか、ありがとう。育こそ、疲れてないか？\nイベント、たくさん盛り上げてくれてたし。", "zh": "这样啊，谢谢你。育才是，你不累吗？\n毕竟你一直让活动变得那么热闹。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0263_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "cf0391471c1687dc042574ddf184d785da579e02971002c9f5532232e5155fc5", "ja": "えっ？　そ、そんなことないよ！\nわたし、まだまだ元気だもん！", "zh": "诶？才、才没有那回事呢！\n我还精神着呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0263_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "675c93435e656ebb938f967e574848d960c06ac2fb96dc2550ac50c60a7ba7bd", "ja": "体育の授業よりは、ちょっと疲れたけど……\nでも、全然だいじょうぶ！", "zh": "虽然比上体育课稍微累了一点……  \n不过，完全没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0263_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3d0ac32ba0d74e99208c5ff1aadf84292bdaf2b4e0de969110da025a86274ab7", "ja": "そうか。一生懸命やってくれて、ありがとうな。", "zh": "这样啊。谢谢你这么努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0263_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "e6c39d45347ad3f5888a1cfde69acff1cccfa7a71fcda8721dd7ff6fd549cd0d", "ja": "ううん！　それに、楽しかったよ。メニューを\n決める時、みんなの好きなものがわかったり……。", "zh": "不是啦！而且，我也觉得很开心。决定菜单\n的时候，还知道了大家喜欢吃什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0263_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "33a279d8107852cae4f05adcc257d8423c826198f2b1a0fec38770c2c34bdc88", "ja": "競争の時も、チームのためにって、みんなで\n勝つ方法を考えたんだよ。だから……ふわ～。", "zh": "比赛的时候，大家也想着要为团队出力，一起想办法获胜。所以……呼啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0263_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "1d0219161d8934e624dc876133f244b891a78751de20bd3a2053965158cdd61b", "ja": "……あっ！　い、今のは、なんでもないよ！", "zh": "……啊！刚、刚才那个，没什么！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0263_1011_p", "source_sha256": "32cd1c0dea36836601a12ba98101f881ded42897b8c9f310ae5bcfaa9a7cdc3b", "ja": "（やっぱり、眠そうだ。小さな体で、\n全力で頑張ってくれたんだものな）", "zh": "（果然还是很困啊。毕竟她用小小的身体拼尽全力努力过了嘛）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0263_1012_p", "source_sha256": "eb30dd87722e78b30b0dd3a9be2c9fa123bdf35d8d38330ffe7e58846fca93fd", "ja": "そろそろ、劇場に戻らないとな。\n育、家まで送っていくよ。", "zh": "差不多该回剧场了。\n育，我送你回家吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0263_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "31dc04720f28716f38492d262512bfe6f4e7853a9fc8290a6588add7d40fc97f", "ja": "だ、大丈夫だよ、{$P$}さん。\nわたし、みんなといっしょで……ふわぁ……。", "zh": "没、没事的，{$P$}先生。  \n我和大家一起……哈啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0263_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "db1067e7b9791b3cac2cee59253c6dd40938c52c9b1c78a1cdec68474e135242", "ja": "ううっ……わたしなら、だいじょうぶだもん。\nだから、子どもあつかいは……ふわぁ……。", "zh": "呜……我没问题的嘛。\n所以，别把我当小孩子……哈啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0263_1015_p", "source_sha256": "e8f253b3f4eac5ae9435bcbc7ed3aea0ae87f6f751519038a64ae91758ed9b3b", "ja": "（特別頑張ってくれたんだから、少しくらい特別扱い\nさせてもらおう。……さて、車を取ってくるか！）", "zh": "（既然她们格外努力了，就稍微特别照顾一下吧。……好了，去把车开过来！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
